Tandem PDF signing crate (tandem-sign) and its WASM module

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

The crate's own code is licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
Shiro-Legacy; the text is in LICENSE at the repository root. This file lists
the third-party Rust packages compiled into the WASM module Electron's main
process loads (build/sign/vendor/tandem_sign_bg.wasm) and its JavaScript glue.
Each package's licence files are retained verbatim under
licenses/<crate>-<version>/, with SHA-256 hashes in
licenses/license-files.json (licenses.sh regenerates both). Versions and
source checksums are pinned in Cargo.lock. Several dependencies contain
internal unsafe code; see DEPENDENCIES.md. The crate itself forbids unsafe
code.

OpenSSL (through node:crypto and the openssl command) and pyHanko are used
only as test oracles (tests/sign-oracle.mjs, tests/sign-differential.test.mjs,
scripts/verify-sign.py). Neither is part of the crate, the module or any app
build.


